sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Platform Management
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>CategoriesPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>DeleteCategoryBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>DeleteCategoryController
  participant Category as «entity»<br/>Category
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: delete an unused category
  UI->>B: DELETE /api/management/categories/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: delete(Integer categoryId)
  alt category used by IDPs
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 409, deactivate instead error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>Category: usageCount()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C->>Category: delete()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C-->>B: void
  B-->>UI: 204 No Content
  UI-->>A: show result
  end